Since you are working with SuperCollider, the porting architecture actually becomes much cleaner. SuperCollider is already explicitly designed as a decoupled client/server application. The realtime audio engine (scsynth) and the language interpreter (sclang) communicate using Open Sound Control (OSC) over network sockets. 
